# Shared action (P#17, M6 CallStmt): fills webV2's iframe-embedded payment widget
# (`webV2/public/payment-widget.html`, PLAN_WEBV2_TARGETS.md's Tier C iframe corner) and completes
# checkout — the same three steps `tests/webv2-storefront.tflw`'s cart-lifecycle tests each need
# once they're ready to check out. `within frame` genuinely traverses the iframe's own document
# (SPEC §9.5); the parent `button "Checkout"` only becomes enabled once the frame's own
# `postMessage` handoff lands, so `wait until` (not a plain `expect`) covers that async gap.

action checkout()
  within frame css "iframe[title='Payment']"
    fill field "Card number" with "4111111111111111"
    fill field "Expiry (MM/YY)" with "12/30"
    fill field "CVC" with "123"
    click button "Authorize payment"
  wait until button "Checkout" is enabled
  click button "Checkout"
  expect text "Order confirmed" is visible
